,"shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","review_id":"3_MkJLPJNFbXpNuhDUIVCg","date":"2018-07-14T18:39:42","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9322622418403625,"text_excerpt":"This place is unheard of in the French quarter. There are so many places to eat at in this area. But I wanted something small with very little hype. I'm glad we found this small place. They have great po boys. I recommended you order the fried shrimp."},{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","review_id":"2HoYIGHJJmy4Q4ByZ_0LRg","date":"2017-06-14T15:23:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9304388165473938,"text_excerpt":"I come from the land of bodegas all over the place, with most serving surprisingly good food. Quarter Grocery & Deli is just like the bodegas I frequent at home. Stocked with essentials, beer, soft drinks, and a deli counter in the back. I've found that the best po'boys in NOLA come from these hole in the wall spots (my first ever was from a gas station and it was delicious). We had already come here to grab a few quick items but finally decided to grab their infamous po'boy on a rainy day. It was delicious...And huge! It was my boyfriend's first po'boy ever and I'm glad it was this one. It was also only around $9, for something that provided two meals for each of us. They accept all majo..."},{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","review_id":"weWQXbs0o6Pqi_eqyx8ykQ","date":"2020-02-19T17:40:04","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.923173189163208,"text_excerpt":"A local recommended this place's fried catfish sandwich as the best in the French Quarter. I got it and it was delicious and a good value. I would absolutely get it again."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","photo_id":"SGagOpqTGXUlKuN0TYWpZA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/SGagOpqTGXUlKuN0TYWpZA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8987925052642822},{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","photo_id":"V_0XgC1SUg7Z_yrZgC6MwQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/V_0XgC1SUg7Z_yrZgC6MwQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8217701315879822},{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","photo_id":"ItjJSqsRvyH6H443gt23Kw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/ItjJSqsRvyH6H443gt23Kw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8022961020469666},{"business_id":"yk5S9Lrs0EUHUKxujlGEAA","photo_id":"LoG1d_p9eU25xWQAbYTwlQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/LoG1d_p9eU25xWQAbYTwlQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7600181698799133}]},"notebook_case":null}
